@startuml
title US11 - Register a Parameter\nClass Diagram (CD)

hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class ConsoleApp {
}

class RegisterParameter {
    -repository : ParameterRepository&
    +RegisterParameter(repository)
    +execute(ID, name, description, metric, metricType, minimum, maximum) : bool
    +execute(ID, name, description, metric, minimum, maximum) : bool
}

class ParameterRepository {
    -parameters : vector<Parameter>
    +existsByID(ID) : bool
    +add(parameter) : bool
    +findByID(ID) : const Parameter*
    +count() : size_t
}

class Parameter {
    -ID : wstring
    -name : wstring
    -description : wstring
    -metric : wstring
    -metricType : MetricType
    -minimumReferenceValue : optional<double>
    -maximumReferenceValue : optional<double>
    +Parameter(ID, name, description, metric, metricType, minimum, maximum)
    +Parameter(ID, name, description, metric, minimum, maximum)
    +getID() : const wstring&
    +getName() : const wstring&
    +getDescription() : const wstring&
    +getMetric() : const wstring&
    +getMetricType() : MetricType
    +getMinimumReferenceValue() : optional<double>
    +getMaximumReferenceValue() : optional<double>
    +{static} isValidID(ID) : bool
    +{static} isNumericMetric(metric) : bool
    +{static} isValidReferenceRange(minimum, maximum) : bool
}

enum MetricType {
    Numeric
    Qualitative
}

ConsoleApp ..> RegisterParameter
RegisterParameter ..> ParameterRepository
RegisterParameter ..> Parameter

ParameterRepository "1" o-- "0..*" Parameter : records
Parameter --> MetricType : uses

note bottom of RegisterParameter
The explicit MetricType overload is used by ConsoleApp.
The other overload preserves legacy compatibility.
minimum/maximum abbreviate the optional reference bounds.
end note

note bottom of ParameterRepository
Current ID comparison is exact and case-sensitive.
The referenced forum clarification requires reconciliation.
No TestTypeParameter associations are stored yet.
end note

@enduml
